					"documentation": "Organization details for bands, orchestras, collectives, agencies, labels and promoters. catalog_identity_id is shared PK/FK to catalog_identities with type=organization. Categories are multiple and optional. Legal name remains optional; no contracts or ownership model. Public name, image and description come from catalog_identities. Founding and dissolution dates are optional hierarchical year/month/day values, following the existing catalog partial-date pattern. Treat each date as a coherent editorial field group. No invented precision; reject a dissolution interval entirely before the founding interval, while retaining uncertainty for overlapping partial intervals.",
