					"documentation": "Musical membership of an organization. UNIQUE NULLS NOT DISTINCT (organization_id,member_identity_id,joined_year,joined_month,joined_day); CHECK organization_id <> member_identity_id. Validate acyclic organization membership and reject definitely overlapping periods, allowing uncertain overlap with partial dates. Unknown date components are NULL. Year 1..9999; month requires year; day requires month and valid Gregorian calendar. Reject a period only if earliest possible entry is later than latest possible departure. status=current|former|unknown. Any known departure requires former; current requires all departure components NULL. Do not inherit musical credits between group and members. Owned by the group identity editorial root. Approved 2026-10-13. See docs/music-catalog-model.md.",
					"columns": [
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGeD8zCE4D0X8w=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGeD8zCE4DzTtg="
