							"name": "editorial_entity_id",
							"documentation": "NOT NULL UNIQUE FK -> editorial_entities.id; ON DELETE RESTRICT. entity_type=recording. Only applied content; reserved drafts have no row here. Enforce matching root type and exclusivity transactionally.",
