							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "92a32306931143e39e7a6bf4d97cf64e"
							},
							"name": "repackage_of_id",
							"type": "INTEGER",
							"documentation": "FK -> release_groups.id; ON DELETE RESTRICT. Original release group relaunched by this repackage; NULL when not a repackage. When set it must reference a published group other than itself, never a reservation or a withdrawn group; chains are allowed and cycles are rejected under lock. If the original is later withdrawn the link is retained and resolves to its withdrawal notice.",
