					},
					"name": "release_artist_credits",
					"documentation": " Presentation credits referencing artists.id, not technical/creative contributions. Retain credited order; no inferred authorship, performance or production. Identity metadata is resolved through artists.catalog_identity_id. See docs/music-catalog-model.md. PK (artist_id,release_group_id); position >= 0. credited_as NULL resolves through artists.catalog_identity_id to catalog_identities.display_name. Owned by the release group editorial root (approved 2026-10-17); editions carry no separate artist credits.",
