					"documentation": "Obra musical abstracta: música y/o letra, independiente de sus grabaciones. Una versión cover puede interpretar la misma obra. Las adaptaciones con cambios de autoría pueden ser obras diferentes. ISWC opcional, no es ISRC ni acredita derechos. No crear obras automáticamente por coincidencia de título. Editorial root: editorial_entity_id owns publication state and version; published and withdrawn rows are retained. Creator/approver and sources are traced through proposals, decisions and revisions. See docs/editorial-contributions.md.",
					"columns": [
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGhKCb1j8AkGTw=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGeQjEemLRh1A0="
							},
							"name": "id",
							"type": "BIGINT",
							"length": 0,
							"primaryKey": true,
							"documentation": "BIGINT primary key and public JSON:API resource identifier for works; serialize as a decimal string, never a JavaScript Number. Editorial operations keep the separate editorial_entity_id UUID."
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
