					},
					"name": "catalog_identities",
					"documentation": "Stable catalog identity for a person or organization. Exactly one matching people/organizations subtype, enforced transactionally. Optional artists profile, at most one per identity. One identity editorial root owns common metadata and the profile. No automatic artist profile for technical/creative credits. No duplicate identity based only on credited_as. See docs/music-catalog-model.md. Editorial root: editorial_entity_id owns publication state and version; published and withdrawn rows are retained. Creator/approver and sources are traced through proposals, decisions and revisions. See docs/editorial-contributions.md.",
					"columns": [
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "umc9gjGj2Lqmuq5McnUPzu5v",
