					"_parent": {
						"$ref": "B947XbePjWnjFjEXZfACOTnP"
					},
					"name": "tours",
					"documentation": "Tour grouping zero or more published concerts. Multiple announced artists allowed; roster does not prove participation in every date. Announced start/end may be partial/unknown; validate possible chronological order. Tour countries and date list are derived from published events; never a second editable list. Same contribution workflow as music: users submit, active moderators/admins may publish directly with audited decisions. See docs/live-events-model.md. scheduled requires at least a known start year. Other historical statuses allow partial dates. Changing tour status never cascades into event statuses. Year 1..9999 and valid hierarchical partial calendar components. Editorial root: editorial_entity_id owns publication state and version; published and withdrawn rows are retained. Creator/approver and sources are traced through proposals, decisions and revisions. See docs/editorial-contributions.md.",
					"columns": [
