					"documentation": "One concrete concert/performance. type=concert in v1. Optional tour; two shows at the same venue/date may be different events, so do not deduplicate by title/date/location. Optional partial date and location; unknown is not a fabricated date. time requires full Gregorian date and IANA timezone; timezone may exist without time. No automatic performed state based on elapsed date. The shared contribution workflow covers schedule, status, participants, organizers, links and tour reassignment; active moderators/admins may apply directly with audited decisions. Previous dates remain in entity_revisions. Year 1..9999, month 1..12 and valid day including leap years. postponed clears current date/time; previous values remain in revisions. cancelled keeps last known date. Unknown/local ambiguous time stays NULL unless evidence resolves it. External sources back all material event facts. Editorial root: editorial_entity_id owns publication state and version; published and withdrawn rows are retained. Creator/approver and sources are traced through proposals, decisions and revisions. See docs/editorial-contributions.md.",
