					"documentation": "One coherent allow-listed operation owned by one editorial root. UNIQUE(proposal_id,id), UNIQUE(id,entity_id), UNIQUE(proposal_id,position). Immutable submitted payload; status/resolved_at maintained only through change_decisions. target_path/target_key are typed domain selectors, never arbitrary SQL/table access. JSONB envelopes distinguish absence from null; references to reserved roots or newly inserted child rows use stable editorial/change UUIDs and explicit dependencies. atomic_group_id groups changes within this proposal; all members apply or resolve together. Dependencies inside a group may be satisfied within its transaction. No overlapping writes within one submitted proposal. Only published roots accept new edits; original creation proposal may contain dependent additions while root is reserved. A draft change on an outdated payload_schema_version is rewritten to the current version when translatable, otherwise its author removes or redoes it before submission. A submitted change keeps its original version and payload: deciding translates it in memory, and an untranslatable one is closed by an automatic mark_obsolete decision. All FKs ON DELETE RESTRICT. See docs/editorial-contributions.md.",
					"columns": [
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "f55453be639e4ee28954c84703126fad",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "id",
							"type": "UUID",
							"primaryKey": true
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "0f3e398c9a17423d8d45d16946ddf1cf",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "proposal_id",
							"documentation": "FK -> change_proposals.id.",
							"type": "UUID",
							"foreignKey": true
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "7dc005e88a4b4b9391096a0756e99bc2",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "entity_id",
							"documentation": "FK -> editorial_entities.id; owner of the edited data.",
							"type": "UUID",
							"foreignKey": true
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "4780664c117d4d6db84436a2140a7378",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "operation",
							"documentation": "create_entity | set_fields | add_relation | update_relation | remove_relation | withdraw_entity",
							"type": "enum"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "60868b95704748b599138c8a0711c374",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "target_path",
							"documentation": "Registered coherent field group or owned relation, e.g. people.height_cm or releases.release_date.",
							"type": "VARCHAR"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "b095cfa2ee5e42828db8dab5789e851c",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "target_key",
							"documentation": "Stable row PK/composite key, or typed change UUID for an insertion in this proposal. NULL for root fields. Never array position.",
							"type": "JSONB",
							"nullable": true
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "37773a286f234fa382f769d1321d2a6c",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "base_version",
							"documentation": "CHECK >= 0. Published revision seen by author; zero only for reserved-root operations.",
							"type": "BIGINT"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "de7667063c66456f91610f48abf59310",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "base_value",
							"documentation": "Immutable expected envelope: exists:boolean, value:typed value. Include relevant preconditions, not unrelated fields.",
							"type": "JSONB"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "1cb1da00cc674e5b90689684ca70dc88",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "proposed_value",
							"documentation": "Immutable proposed envelope; exists=false for removal, not SQL NULL. Typed root/child UUID references remain original.",
							"type": "JSONB"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "b5885e5237134e77a0664ba588e7b6aa",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "payload_schema_version",
							"documentation": "No DEFAULT; CHECK > 0. Versioned allow-listed operation schema; the server stores the registry's current version when a draft change omits it. A published version's shape never changes: a different shape is a new version. Fixed once submitted; a draft may be rewritten to the current version.",
							"type": "SMALLINT"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "a4f7d42e33264ef5b1c89bd4428b5b18",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "atomic_group_id",
							"documentation": "Optional group scoped by proposal_id; never spans proposals.",
							"type": "UUID",
							"nullable": true
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "fff252d780da4b5aba40aa7fb72400da",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "position",
							"documentation": "CHECK >= 0. Stable submission order; not dependency order.",
							"type": "INTEGER"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "65e222f23182456a9f070b3e2d094d95",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "status",
							"documentation": "pending | conflicted | applied | rejected | satisfied | blocked | withdrawn; DEFAULT pending. blocked means terminal dependency failure or an untranslatable obsolete payload_schema_version, not a temporary wait.",
							"type": "enum"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "c1b4726a754641e6841600d50c0e8b58",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "created_at",
							"type": "TIMESTAMPTZ"
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "c7a3b681d8964cc199e65b7e3cf8251c",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "5250d6cd46b7454594fe3de5a57865dc"
							},
							"name": "resolved_at",
							"documentation": "NULL iff pending/conflicted; terminal outcome timestamp.",
							"type": "TIMESTAMPTZ",
							"nullable": true
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"_type": "ERDEntity",
					"_id": "2171fb000caf4ad79cf7c74f82632153",
					"_parent": {
						"$ref": "dc6874edb22f477fb2927a700c06cfbe"
					},
					"name": "change_dependencies",
					"documentation": "Explicit directed acyclic dependencies within one proposal. CHECK change_id <> depends_on_change_id. Composite FKs (proposal_id,change_id) and (proposal_id,depends_on_change_id) -> proposal_changes(proposal_id,id); no cross-proposal draft references. Validate DAG on submission; prohibit cycles after collapsing atomic groups as well. Pending/conflicted prerequisite blocks execution but leaves dependent pending; rejected/blocked/withdrawn prerequisite makes dependent blocked. applied/satisfied unlocks only if required current postcondition still holds. All FKs ON DELETE RESTRICT.",
					"columns": [
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "52a0d5428de347d0a8a86ecfa66c1a2c",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "2171fb000caf4ad79cf7c74f82632153"
							},
							"name": "change_id",
							"documentation": "Dependent microchange; composite FK with proposal_id.",
							"type": "UUID",
							"primaryKey": true,
							"foreignKey": true
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "5bdfa0a9f9164d38acba70468f117586",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "2171fb000caf4ad79cf7c74f82632153"
							},
							"name": "depends_on_change_id",
							"documentation": "Prerequisite microchange; composite FK with proposal_id.",
							"type": "UUID",
							"primaryKey": true,
							"foreignKey": true
						},
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "49119814b56f4798bb1387a647ae9ee7",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "2171fb000caf4ad79cf7c74f82632153"
							},
							"name": "proposal_id",
							"documentation": "Same proposal on both composite FKs.",
							"type": "UUID",
							"foreignKey": true
						}
					]
