					],
					"documentation": "General evidence for the whole proposal; at least one at submission including staff publication. UNIQUE(proposal_id,id). CHECK a nonblank URL or nonblank citation_text exists. URL, when provided, must be HTTP(S); bibliographic citations need no URL. Freeze sources after submission and retain with history even for rejected changes. Existing musical source_text/source_url fields remain independent domain evidence. All FKs ON DELETE RESTRICT.",
					"columns": [
						{
							"_type": "ERDColumn",
							"_id": "8b21c7f4cb08456484fe8b6313570b35",
